flow Register
note """
The REGISTRATION fixture, carry-in (h)'s second half. It declares a plain named
struct as a flow var, which makes it a frame stack key the codec carries at an
interface site. Nothing here is refusable: the point is that generation
SUCCEEDS and the generated package registers the type.
"""
var memo Memo
on error Alert
source ingest Feed()
transform tally Count from ingest
  reads memo  writes memo
sink emit Report from tally
